@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor White
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor White

participant "AF" as AF
participant "NEF" as NEF

== Subscription ==

AF -> NEF : Nnef_AnalyticsExposure Subscribe Request
NEF --> AF : Nnef_AnalyticsExposure Subscribe Response
rnote right of NEF : Analytics reporting\n(periodic / one-time / on event detection)
NEF -> AF : Nnef_AnalyticsExposure Notify

== Fetch ==

AF -> NEF : Nnef_AnalyticsExposure Fetch Request
NEF --> AF : Nnef_AnalyticsExposure Fetch Response

@enduml